<div class="title-block">
  <h1 style="border:none; color:#0f172a; font-size:26pt; margin-bottom:4px;">Capstone Enterprise Deliverables</h1>
  <div style="font-size:14pt; color:#06b6d4; font-weight:bold; margin-bottom:12px;">Scalable Enterprise Architectural Deployments of Agentic AI Solutions</div>
  <div class="meta">
    Author: Manikandan &nbsp;|&nbsp; Roll Number: 2023103519 &nbsp;|&nbsp; Directory: 2023103519-Manikandan &nbsp;|&nbsp; Date: October 2026
